;> </span>General Certificate Examination<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.1pt&dq;> </span>or<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>its<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.15pt&dq;> </span>equivalent. The programme duration shall\r\nbe for a period of four academic sessions (eight semesters) for<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>UTME<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.15pt&dq;> </span>candidates<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.05pt&dq;> </span>and<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.15pt&dq;> </span>three<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.05pt&dq;> </span>academic<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.1pt&dq;>\r\n</span>sessions<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.1pt&dq;> </span>(six semester)<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.05pt&dq;> </span>for<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.1pt&dq;> </span>Direct<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.1pt&dq;> </span>Entry<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.05pt&dq;> </span>candidates.<o:p></o:p></span></p>",
