    "utme_requirements": "<p class=&dq;MsoBodyText&dq; style=&dq;margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.4pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n115%;tab-stops:436.5pt&dq;><span lang=&dq;EN-US&dq; style=&dq;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif&dq;>In addition to appropriate Unified\r\nTertiary Matriculation Examination scores, candidate must<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>obtain<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>five<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>Senior<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>Secondary<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>Certificate<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:\r\n.05pt&dq;> </span>(SSC)<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>(or<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>its<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>equivalent)<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>credit<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>passes<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;> </span>including<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:.05pt&dq;>\r\n</span>Mathematics,<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.1pt&dq;> </span>Physics,<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.1pt&dq;> </span>Chemistry,<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:\r\n-.1pt&dq;> </span>Biology<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.2pt&dq;> </span>and<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.15pt&dq;> </span>English<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.15pt&dq;>\r\n</span>Language<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.1pt&dq;> </span>at<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.2pt&dq;> </span><b>not more<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:\r\n-.15pt&dq;> </span>than<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.15pt&dq;> </span>two<span style=&dq;letter-spacing:-.1pt&dq;> </span>sittings.<o:p></o:p></b></span></p>",
